        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Protótipo de Tartaruga. Tirtouga habitava mares antigos. Embora só consiga rastejar em terra, ainda sai da água para procurar presas. Considerado ancestral de muitos Pokémon tartaruga, ele foi restaurado a partir de um fóssil.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Água 1, Água 3 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Tirtouga pode evoluir para Carracosta no nível 13 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Bide, Water Gun, Withdraw</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Rollout</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Protect</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Aqua Jet</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Ancient Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Crunch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Wide Guard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Brine</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Iron Defense, Smack Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Curse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Shell Smash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Aqua Tail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Hydro Pump, Rain Dance, Rock Slide</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aqua Tail, Attract, Blizzard, Block, Brine, Bulldoze, Confide, Dig, Dive, Double Team, Earth Power, Earthquake, Facade, Frustration, Guard Swap, Hidden Power, Ice Beam, Icy Wind, Iron Defense, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Liquidation, Meteor Beam, Mud Shot, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rock Blast, Rock Polish, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Sandstorm, Scald, Sleep Talk, Smack Down, Snore, Stealth Rock, Stone Edge, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Toxic, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Whirlpool, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Bide, Block, Body Slam, Flail, Guard Swap, Iron Defense, Knock Off, Liquidation, Rock Throw, Rollout, Slam, Water Pulse, Whirlpool</p>",
